IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sgta-i-rg5-as-made`

-- Tests of sgta-i-rg5-as-made.l4.  The comparison table's expectations are the result of the script comparison of S 114/2001 against the 2002 Revised Edition regulation by regulation (59 of the 80
-- regulations the same words; the 21 others named), spot-checked here on the provisions the seat uses (regs 2, 19, 65, 68) and on the ones that differ.  The date expectations are computed from the rule
-- as the module states it (the latest published among the versions published on or before the reading day whose effective day is on or before the conduct day).  Every case is a pair of days: CONDUCT first, READING second.

§ `The comparison table`
#ASSERT `Rg 5 as made (S 114/2001): the words of the regulation are those of the 2002 Revised Edition` "2" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Rg 5 as made (S 114/2001): the words of the regulation are those of the 2002 Revised Edition` "19" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Rg 5 as made (S 114/2001): the words of the regulation are those of the 2002 Revised Edition` "65" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Rg 5 as made (S 114/2001): the words of the regulation are those of the 2002 Revised Edition` "68" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Rg 5 as made (S 114/2001): the words of the regulation are those of the 2002 Revised Edition` "78" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Rg 5 as made (S 114/2001): the words of the regulation are those of the 2002 Revised Edition` "1" EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Rg 5 as made (S 114/2001): the words of the regulation are those of the 2002 Revised Edition` "9" EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Rg 5 as made (S 114/2001): the words of the regulation are those of the 2002 Revised Edition` "26" EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Rg 5 as made (S 114/2001): the words of the regulation are those of the 2002 Revised Edition` "28" EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Rg 5 as made (S 114/2001): the words of the regulation are those of the 2002 Revised Edition` "29" EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Rg 5 as made (S 114/2001): the words of the regulation are those of the 2002 Revised Edition` "36" EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Rg 5 as made (S 114/2001): the words of the regulation are those of the 2002 Revised Edition` "80" EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Rg 5 as made (S 114/2001): the words of the regulation are those of the 2002 Revised Edition` "Second Schedule" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Rg 5 as made (S 114/2001): the words of the regulation are those of the 2002 Revised Edition` "Third Schedule" EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Rg 5 as made (S 114/2001): the words of the regulation are those of the 2002 Revised Edition` "First Schedule" EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Rg 5 as made (S 114/2001): the words of the regulation are those of the 2002 Revised Edition` "81" EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Rg 5 as made (S 114/2001): how the words of the regulation differ from the 2002 Revised Edition` "65" EQUALS JUST "no difference in the words"
#ASSERT `Rg 5 as made (S 114/2001): how the words of the regulation differ from the 2002 Revised Edition` "40" EQUALS JUST "'one year' as made, '12 months' in the Revised Edition"
#ASSERT `Rg 5 as made (S 114/2001): how the words of the regulation differ from the 2002 Revised Edition` "81" EQUALS NOTHING

